OL,3,GNEWSANHS supply lorry drivers to strike
OL,4,Ain pay dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS supply lorry drivers are set for a
OL,7,Fseries of strikes in a dispute over
OL,8,Fpay.
OL,10,FDrivers employed by GXO in Tyne and
OL,11,FWear, Derbyshire, Yorkshire, Kent,
OL,12,FWarwickshire and Suffolk will stage
OL,13,Ffive walkouts from October 13-15,
OL,14,F20-22, 27-29 and November 3-5 and
OL,15,F10-12, Unite said.
OL,17,FUnion members have rejected a 4% pay
OL,18,Foffer from GXO, which runs the NHS
OL,19,Fsupply chain contract for Supply Chain
OL,20,FCoordination Limited (SCCL), and is
OL,21,Fwholly owned by NHS England.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
